No old source, SQL, test, dependency, runtime route or configuration is edited by the implementation agent. The completed primitive remains inactive and nondeployable alone. Versioned proof/cleanup/admission/capacity, exact close-before-register precedence, real Auth ownership/policy/revocation evidence and quiesced no-fallback cutover remain unfinished. Auth/SQL reads are not atomic and transport invocation association remains trusted. No real Auth/model/provider/device call or deployment was made.

